{"agent_id":"6Vw9","agent_seq":1076,"timestamp":"2026-08-23T02:23:00.126907409Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"cb7d5e52-6550-4867-a029-52d7930b427b","comment_uuid":"f0ffe500-8109-4783-8c19-96edbf3abcfd","author":"6Vw9","content":"Architecture decision: use one typed model-catalog snapshot that separates canonical identity/aliases, authenticated account access, lifecycle, feature support, limits, pricing certainty, and evidence provenance/freshness. Provider discovery adapters parse only fields their APIs actually attest: Gemini supplies generation methods, thinking and token limits; Ollama tags/show supplies installed-model capabilities; OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic lists primarily attest identity/access, then exact entries may be enriched by the small dated emergency manifest or explicit operator metadata. A bounded in-process cache is keyed by provider plus normalized endpoint and never by credentials. Selection and request validation consume the same resolution result; expired fallback evidence cannot enable tools/thinking/streaming. Alternative rejected: periodically refreshing the existing static string lists leaves context, pricing and request patches as independent name-guess authorities and cannot represent unavailable, limited, deprecated, or unknown states.","created_at":"2026-08-23T02:23:00.124237418Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABABVnfxS8wQrpYnQFKaRIEZtxTyIKC5vE9BlsBJtMkLnNwhpzd8oIYhMps1j4qNFBSt6POz5cCKZHQtW2Tgk0hDQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:j+T69HS/M0AwPawKX5c+EFy9FaQnZPkMoDhPY7douB4","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg3hUp0i9PNKQQMq2guEzD3AVit1zRcPhExHUTd0ybTloAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLwGs+ws3/wJbL2qH4TGORB3HYbZrdnR+IQSPO2H6BsLDv0RziYijuNY6a5uOw